\par\par \b \uc2 Maltese Hoard Local  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  Ahead Of Switch To Euro -AFP   \b0\par\par\uc2 279 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Dezember 2007\par 16:35\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 VALLETTA, Malta (AFP)--Some EUR466 million in Maltese liri is being hoarded in people's homes, Malta's bank chief said Saturday, just two days before the island nation enters the euro zone.   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Michael Bonello said one of the difficulties Malta had on its way to joining the euro was "the high volume of money in circulation."   \par \par \uc2 "However, from a high of EUR1.165 billion worth of Maltese liri in circulation in 2005, over EUR656 million have entered again into the system," he said.   \par \par \uc2 Joseph Zahra, chairman of the National Euro Changeover Committee, said he was satisfied even if "sometimes there was tension in the Committee between representatives of the consumers and those of the retailers."   \par \par \uc2 The  \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Malta\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Friday it had cut its central \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate to 4.0% to complete the convergence of official rates in Malta to those in the eurozone area.   \par \par \uc2 The tiny Mediterranean island nations of Cyprus and Malta join the euro zone on Jan. 1, turning the single-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  area from a 13-country zone into a club of 15.   \par \par \uc2 Both have earned high marks from the European Commission for their preparations, aimed primarily at attracting new investment.   \par \par \uc2 The NECC has led a massive euro information campaign in Malta that has earned a "best practice" distinction from the European Union. It meant that euro assistants paid 21,000 visits to over 7,000 retail units to explain the changeover.   \par \par \uc2 The NECC administered the Fair Agreement In Retail Pricing, which compels retailers not to take advantage of the changeover to try and increase prices. [ 29-12-07 1535GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020071229e3ct0002f\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
