\par\par \b \uc2 ECB Sets  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Rates For New ERM  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 246 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Mai 2005\par 09:05\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 FRANKFURT (Dow Jones)--The European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monday said it has set the compulsory \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates for the Cyprus pound, the Latvian lats and the Maltese lira after the three countries joined the European Exchange Rate Mechanism Friday.  \par \par \uc2 The ECB said the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates will take effect as of Monday. [ 02-05-05 0705GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 The ECB said the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates have been agreed by common accord between the ECB and the national central banks of Cyprus, Latvia and \b \highlight22\uc2 Malta\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 The ECB's euro central rates and compulsory \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates are unchanged for the Danish krone, Estonian kroon, Lithuanian litas, and Slovenian tolar.  \par \par \uc2 A table of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates versus the euro, provided by the ECB, follows below:  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                       Upper Rate       7.62824 \par Danish Krone          Central Rate     7.46038 \par                       Lower Rate       7.29252 \par  \par                       Upper Rate      17.9936 \par Estonian Kroon        Central Rate    15.6466 \par                       Lower Rate      13.2996 \par  \par                       Upper Rate       0.673065 \par Cyprus Pound          Central Rate     0.585274 \par                       Lower Rate       0.497483 \par  \par                       Upper Rate       0.808225 \par Latvian Lats          Central Rate     0.702804 \par                       Lower Rate       0.597383 \par  \par                       Upper Rate       3.97072 \par Lithuanian Litas      Central Rate     3.45280 \par                       Lower Rate       2.93488 \par  \par                       Upper Rate       0.493695 \par Maltese Lira          Central Rate     0.429300 \par                       Lower Rate       0.364905 \par  \par                       Upper Rate     275.586 \par Slovenian Tolar       Central Rate   239.640 \par                       Lower Rate     203.694 \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -By Klaus Brune and Oliver Biggadike, Dow Jones Newswires; +49-69-2972-5500; oliver.biggadike@dowjones.com. [ 02-05-05 0732GMT ]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020050502e1520005e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
