\par\par \b \uc2  Malta c.bank leaves interest rates unchanged. \b0\par\par\uc2 318 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Januar 2003\par 19:48\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  VALLETTA, Jan 16 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Malta\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday left its central \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate and the discount rate unchanged at 3.75 percent after a meeting of its Monetary Policy Advisory Council. \par \par \uc2  Bank governor Michael Bonello said that after the reduction of 25 basis points in December, official interest rates remained compatible with the maintenance of the exchange rate peg in the current domestic and international environment. \par \par \uc2  The Malta pound is pegged to the US dollar, the euro and the pound sterling, with the three \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  weighed according to the level of Maltese trade in those \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Bonello said the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's external reserves had stabilised in December and into January, indicating the absence of pressures on the exchange rate peg. He said the council also noted that the December cut in official interest rates had little immediate impact on domestic financial markets, as money market interest rates had already fallen in anticipation of the bank's decision. \par \par \uc2  Bonello also said in a Maltese newspaper on Thursday that in a small, open economy like Malta's interest rates had to be set at a slightly higher level than those abroad, because investors perceived more risk in investing in such a vulnerable economy and expected to be compensated accordingly. \par \par \uc2  The bank, therefore, considered cutting interest rates only if it believed that this would not expose the exchange rate to downward pressures. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has effected a 25-basis point cut in its central \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate on four occasions during the past two years. It has also lowered the reserve requirement ratio by 100 basis points, which has the effect of increasing the liquid resources of the commercial banks and, therefore, their ability to lend. \par \par \uc2  " As a result of these cuts, interest rates in Malta are currently at their lowest level in many years." \par \par \uc2  $1 = 0.41 Malta pounds. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030116dz1g010qe\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
